153
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:46,000
Hello, everyone. Today's lecture will focus on how to fight against stress.

154
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:49,620
Every human being experiences stress in life.

155
00:14:50,260 --> 00:14:56,700
Our tiring jobs, faulty eating habits, and pollution may add to the cause of stress.

156
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:59,620
