00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:16,000
When you feel stress, your body produces chemicals which lead to an increase in

161
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:21,560
blood pressure, high blood sugar levels, and, in the worst case, may lead to major

162
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:27,820
