170
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:04,720
etc. Outdoor walking.

171
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:11,100
is an inexpensive, low -risk, and the easiest accessible form of exercise.

172
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:15,820
