173
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:21,860
Meditation. Meditation is certainly the best way to keep stress at bay.

174
00:16:22,340 --> 00:16:28,160
As studies suggest, daily 25 minutes of focused meditation drastically affects

175
00:16:28,160 --> 00:16:31,240
